1
00:00:00,321 --> 00:00:04,051
Ah. People say I'm a little awkward too.

2
00:00:05,259 --> 00:00:07,019
(Man:)May I join you?

3
00:00:08,228 --> 00:00:10,358
(Raj:)No, you can't join us.

4
00:00:10,531 --> 00:00:14,191
(Raj:)Go climb back up whatever beanstalk
you came down from.

5
00:00:19,907 --> 00:00:21,397
(Man(to Lucy):)You can do better.

6
00:00:26,046 --> 00:00:28,246
(Lucy:)Oh, we're eating here?

7
00:00:34,455 --> 00:00:36,255
(Lucy:)We're having a texting date?

8
00:00:40,961 --> 00:00:42,091
(Lucy:)I love that.

9
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:51,670
(Raj(by text):)As you're reading, it will help
to remember I have an adorable accent.

10
00:00:55,376 --> 00:01:03,026
(Leonard:)Okay, who's ready for some science?

